{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029510/extras/18451b89eb82a7bd29b52abdfb6f25af.avif?t=1760637873\" width=1153 height=291 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There is no tragedy in it, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">for only in the end can a beginning be born. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">They say the <strong>Crimson Core</strong> held the heart of the world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But on the day the Prism Wizard took it from humanity, its light went out\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">announcing the <strong>apocalypse</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The skies filled with storms engraved <strong>with ancient runes</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The tides devoured the shores. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Plagues and misfortunes were unleashed upon the land. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">For centuries, <strong>the Iron Order protected the Continent from darkness.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Today, its voice resounds in one last Crusade that rises toward the edge of the sky: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">the Infinity Tower. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Ten vaults.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Ten worlds.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Ten trials</strong> that will decide whether saving the world is worth the price demanded by such a mission. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Among the crusaders marches a young one, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">a lesser dragon, stubborn and bright, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">a spark in the midst of dusk. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Red Crusade has begun.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And if the end comes, those who seek salvation in the <strong>Tower</strong> will be the last to know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029510/extras/53576a0debd44ea8ee7b6185e1aa9c59.avif?t=1760637873\" width=1157 height=79 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A deep, expansive story</strong> divided into episodes that explore the mysterious vaults of the Tower.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An original, immersive soundtrack</strong> composed to enhance every key moment of the adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Available in both Spanish and English</strong>, with full localization in each language.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029510/extras/32d3d8b8ff99aa6fd89db8b21c751b31.avif?t=1760637873\" width=549 height=137 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029510/extras/6fe4b901bf22dae5081fdef9c65dba80.avif?t=1760637873\" width=549 height=137 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029510/extras/0b069037ee3acec1fa9828a581263e05.avif?t=1760637873\" width=549 height=137 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4029510?t=1760637873","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029510/8fb87f5ff4f6c1f253e9d347d15c3872175ae356/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760637873","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029510/099027250cb302358dbacd75a38bedc25b67182f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760637873","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029510/099027250cb302358dbacd75a38bedc25b67182f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760637873","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77}],"content_descriptors":{"ids